@hideUI TitleUI
@stopBgm fade:0.5
@processInput set:Pause.false,Rollback.false

; --- 1. Negro inicial ---
@back OkinawaSunset tint:black time:0
@sfx OceanSound Time:2 volume:0.3 loop!
@sfx CricketsFireflies Time:2 volume:0.3 loop!
@showPrinter YuinaIntroPrinter
@printer YuinaIntroPrinter default! !hideOther

; --- 2. Narración sobre negro ---
Okinawa. The southern edge of the line.
A place where the sea speaks softly, where the air is warm, and where even the tracks seem to hesitate before going any farther.
Somewhere beyond the shore, the evening tide breathed against the sand.
The usually busy platform was unusually quiet. Too quiet, perhaps, for a train that seemed to be waiting for someone.

; --- 3. Fundido al atardecer ---
@back OkinawaSunset tint:white time:3 wait!
@bgm LaCancionDelPollo volume:0.7 loop!

; --- 4. La escena ---
The train rested beside the coast, still and silent.
Out of service, it seemed. How could that be?
And yet... it was here. Something about it felt intentional.
As if it had been waiting here for a very long time...
...for someone who could give it a reason to depart.

; --- 5. Ella (el CG close-up baja desde arriba a la derecha, fondo detrás) ---
A beautiful, elegant train conductor stood by one of the carriage windows, watching the sunset spill over the sea.
For a moment, she didn't move. Everything felt as if time itself had stopped.

; CG fuera de pantalla (derecha, arriba, invisible), luego baja con fundido.
@char YuinaCG.Look pos:30,110 scale:0.82 tint:#ffffff00 time:2 wait!
@char YuinaCG.Look pos:30,-20 tint:#ffffffff time:2 easing:EaseOutQuad wait!

Then, slowly, she turned. As if she had felt someone watching.
The girl looked at you, unsurprised. Her gaze invited you closer. 
She seemed to have something to tell you.
Her expression was as delicate as the sound of the sea. 
The wind caressed her hair as if they were acquainted since forever.

; --- 6. Yuina habla con el CG presente (IntroPrinter grande) ---
@showPrinter YuinaIntroPrinter
@printer YuinaIntroPrinter default! !hideOther

@voice yuina_entry_06_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: ...Oh.
@voice yuina_entry_06_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: From the way you're looking at me, I can tell you're not from around here.
@voice yuina_entry_06_003 volume:0.7
Yuina: So you really did find me.

; --- Cuarta pared: tú diste el paso ---
@voice yuina_entry_06_004 volume:0.7
Yuina: You pressed "New Game", didn't you?
@voice yuina_entry_06_005 volume:0.7
Yuina: That means you chose to come here.
@voice yuina_entry_06_006 volume:0.7
Yuina: I've been waiting on this platform for someone to open this software. I'm glad it was you.
@voice yuina_entry_06_007 volume:0.7
Yuina: If you hadn't come... I suppose I would've stayed here forever.
@voice yuina_entry_06_008 volume:0.7
Yuina: At least I had a beautiful view.
@voice yuina_entry_06_009 volume:0.7
Yuina: The sea, the sunset, the sound of everything...
@voice yuina_entry_06_010 volume:0.7
Yuina: It almost makes waiting feel peaceful.
@voice yuina_entry_06_011 volume:0.7
Yuina: ...
@voice yuina_entry_06_012 volume:0.7
Yuina: Starting is already a big part of the journey, you know?
@voice yuina_entry_06_013 volume:0.7
Yuina: A train doesn't reach the north by thinking about moving.
@voice yuina_entry_06_014 volume:0.7
Yuina: It moves because someone gives it a reason to.
@voice yuina_entry_06_015 volume:0.7
Yuina: Ah.
@voice yuina_entry_06_016 volume:0.7 
Yuina: How rude of me. I shouldn't introduce myself from a window like this.
@voice yuina_entry_06_017 volume:0.7 
Yuina: Give me a moment, I'll hop off.

She actually hopped down from the window.

; --- El CG se retira (sube y se desvanece); entra el sprite normal ---
@back OkinawaSunset2 time:1
@slide YuinaCG to:30,115 time:0.8 wait!
@hide YuinaCG time:0


@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: There.

@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.8
@voice yuina_entry_07_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: Better, right?

@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_003 volume:0.7 
Yuina: You can probably already see my name on the screen, so I suppose I don't need to introduce myself.

@char Yuina.What scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_004 volume:0.7 
Yuina: Unless you can't read it.
@voice yuina_entry_07_005 volume:0.7 
Yuina: In which case... we may have even more work to do than I thought.

@char Yuina.Announce scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_006 volume:0.7 
Yuina: My full name is Nishizono Yuina. I'm a train conductor by trade.

@char Yuina.Angry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_007 volume:0.7 
Yuina: But my real passion is language acquisition.
@voice yuina_entry_07_008 volume:0.7 
Yuina: How people learn, how they forget.
@voice yuina_entry_07_009 volume:0.7
Yuina: How they keep going even when nothing seems to be changing.

@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_010 volume:0.7 
Yuina: I suppose that's why I love travelling, too.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_07_011 volume:0.7 
Yuina: A journey and a language are very similar. You don't feel every meter.
@voice yuina_entry_07_012 volume:0.7 
Yuina: But one day, you look back... and realize the place where you started is far behind you.

@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_001 volume:0.7 
Yuina: This train is bound for Wakkanai.
@voice yuina_entry_08_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: We begin here, near Okinawa, at the southern edge of the journey.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_003 volume:0.7 
Yuina: But this isn't an ordinary railway at all. It doesn't even run on tickets. 
@voice yuina_entry_08_004 volume:0.7 
Yuina: It runs on immersion. On the minutes and hours you spend with the Japanese language.
@voice yuina_entry_08_005 volume:0.7 
Yuina: Reading it. Listening to it. Watching it.

@char Yuina.Serious scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_006 volume:0.7 
Yuina: Every minute you log becomes energy for this train.
@voice yuina_entry_08_007 volume:0.7
Yuina: And every time the train moves... I can guide you a little farther.
@voice yuina_entry_08_008 volume:0.7
Yuina: I can teach you something useful, show you where you are, and remind you why the process works.

;; --- Por qué te necesita ---
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_009 volume:0.7
Yuina: ...
@voice yuina_entry_08_010 volume:0.7
Yuina: The truth is...
@voice yuina_entry_08_011 volume:0.7
Yuina: I can't move this train alone.
@voice yuina_entry_08_012 volume:0.7
Yuina: Japanese is already my language.
@voice yuina_entry_08_013 volume:0.7
Yuina: I grew up with it. So I have no journey to log.

@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_014 volume:0.7
Yuina: But you do.
@voice yuina_entry_08_015 volume:0.7
Yuina: You still have distance ahead of you.
@voice yuina_entry_08_016 volume:0.7
Yuina: And that means you still have energy to give.

@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_017 volume:0.55
Yuina: We'll travel across Japan together.
@voice yuina_entry_08_018 volume:0.8
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
Yuina: And if you trust me...
@voice yuina_entry_08_019 volume:0.9
Yuina: and yourself...
@voice yuina_entry_08_020 volume:0.73
@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
Yuina: you'll go much farther than you think.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_021 volume:0.7
Yuina: I'll make sure this becomes a journey worth remembering.
@voice yuina_entry_08_022 volume:0.7
@char Yuina.Angry scale:0.5
Yuina: And I'm not being dramatic.
@voice yuina_entry_08_023 volume:0.7
@char Yuina.What scale:0.5
Yuina: Well. Not only dramatic.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_024 volume:0.7
Yuina: Acquiring a language is a little like being born again.

@char Yuina.Serious scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_025 volume:0.7
Yuina: You see, learning a language is a long... very long journey.
@voice yuina_entry_08_026 volume:0.7
Yuina: It takes hundreds, even thousands of hours to reach a high level.
@voice yuina_entry_08_027 volume:0.7
Yuina: This train moves when you move. As long as you log your journey, those hours turn into energy.
@voice yuina_entry_08_028 volume:0.7
Yuina: There will be times you feel like you're not moving at all. The road may feel long, heavy... even silent.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_08_029 volume:0.7
Yuina: But even the greatest journeys begin with a single entry in the log.

; --- Invitación / elección ---
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_09_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: So then.
@voice yuina_entry_09_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: Will you go on with me?

@set noCount=0

# Ask
@choice "Yes, let's go." goto:#Yes
@choice "No." goto:#No
@stop

# Yes
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_yes_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: Hehe~ I knew you would.
@voice yuina_entry_yes_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: I can see the determination in your eyes.

@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_yes_003 volume:0.7
Yuina: Then we're almost ready.
@voice yuina_entry_yes_004 volume:0.7
Yuina: Before we begin...
@voice yuina_entry_yes_005 volume:0.7
Yuina: tell me what you'd like me to call you.

@set PlayerName=""
@input PlayerName summary:"How would you like Yuina to call you?" type:string
@savePlayerName

@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_yes_006 volume:0.7
Yuina: {PlayerName}...

@char Yuina.Hehe
@voice yuina_entry_yes_007 volume:0.7
Yuina: Yes.
@voice yuina_entry_yes_008 volume:0.7
Yuina: That is a name worth remembering.

@char Yuina.Talk scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_yes_009 volume:0.7
Yuina: Then let me show you the operations panel.
@char Yuina.Happy scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_yes_010 volume:0.7
Yuina: Don't worry.
@voice yuina_entry_yes_011 volume:0.7
Yuina: You'll get used to it before you know it.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_yes_012 volume:0.7
Yuina: And before we realize it...
@voice yuina_entry_yes_013 volume:0.7
Yuina: your progress will take us through many places across Japan.

@wait 0.4
@hideAll
@stopSfx CricketsFireflies
@stopSfx OceanSound
@goto MainTracker

; --- Bucle del "No" ---
# No
@set noCount=noCount+1
@goto #NoThird if:noCount>=3
@goto #NoFirst if:noCount==1
@goto #NoSecond if:noCount==2
@stop

# NoFirst
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no1_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: ...Eh?

@char Yuina.Angry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no1_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: No?
@voice yuina_entry_no1_003 volume:0.7
Yuina: Ah, jeez. You were definitely the funniest one in class. Haha.
@voice yuina_entry_no1_004 volume:0.7
Yuina: I can't believe I explained all this for nothing...

@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no1_005 volume:0.7
Yuina: Ahem.
@voice yuina_entry_no1_006 volume:0.7
Yuina: Fine. I'm asking you again.
@voice yuina_entry_no1_007 volume:0.7
Yuina: Will you go on with me?

@goto #Ask

# NoSecond
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no2_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: ...You're really going to keep saying no?
@voice yuina_entry_no2_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: Come on.
@voice yuina_entry_no2_003 volume:0.7
Yuina: I don't want to stay here for another eternity.
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no2_004 volume:0.7
Yuina: Okinawa is pretty nice, though.

@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no2_005 volume:0.7
Yuina: But I need to reach Wakkanai...
@voice yuina_entry_no2_006 volume:0.7
Yuina: And I want you to learn...
@voice yuina_entry_no2_007 volume:0.7
Yuina: Will you go on with me?
@voice yuina_entry_no2_008 volume:0.7
Yuina: Please?

@goto #Ask

# NoThird
@char Yuina.Angry scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no3_001 volume:0.7
Yuina: Hmph...

@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no3_002 volume:0.7
Yuina: Fine, fine. I understand.
@voice yuina_entry_no3_003 volume:0.7
Yuina: I can take a hint... for sure.

@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
@voice yuina_entry_no3_004 volume:0.7
Yuina: Hehehe...
@voice yuina_entry_no3_005 volume:0.7
Yuina: Then I hope you LOVE grammar drills... rote kanji memorization...
@voice yuina_entry_no3_006 volume:0.7
@char Yuina.Angry scale:0.5
Yuina: ...and doing Minna no Nihongo and Genki exercises forever!

@wait 1.5
@quitGame
@stop